        }
      }
    },
    "Enter your password once more so the watch gets its own sign-in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请再输入一次密码，让手表获得自己的登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every 90 minutes of running time, Hope suggests a break. Exercise and the timetable are left alone. The watch reminds first; the iPhone only if it did not." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "计时每满 90 分钟，Hope 提醒你歇一歇。运动类活动和课表不提醒。手表先提醒，手表没提醒时 iPhone 才会。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exercise and the timetable are not reminded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
